### IPP-1201 live deploy checks (Render API + Vercel website)
### How to use: put your real addresses below, then "Send Request" top to bottom.
### The first request can take up to ~1 minute (free Render server waking up).

@api = https://YOUR-RENDER-APP.onrender.com/api
@site = https://YOUR-VERCEL-APP.vercel.app
@testEmail = arsalmustafa62+ipp-live1@gmail.com


### 1. Health -> expect 200 { success: true, message: "API is running", data: { ip } }
###    "ip" must be YOUR internet IP (check whatismyip.com). If it is another IP, set TRUST_PROXY=2 on Render.
GET {{api}}/health


### 2. CORS from the website -> expect 200 and header  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: {{site}}
GET {{api}}/languages
Origin: {{site}}


### 3. CORS from another site -> expect NO Access-Control-Allow-Origin header (browser would block it)
GET {{api}}/languages
Origin: https://evil.example.com


### 4. Dev test routes are off in production -> expect 404
GET {{api}}/dev/protected


### 5. Not logged in -> expect 401
GET {{api}}/auth/me


### 6. Register -> expect 201 with data.emailSent = true, then an email from Brevo (check Spam too).
###    emailSent false = Brevo problem: Render -> Logs shows the reason ("[email] ...").
###    The link in the email must start with {{site}}/verify-email/...  Click it -> "Email verified".
POST {{api}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Live Test",
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "password": "secret456"
}


### 7. Login after verifying -> expect 200 with a token
# @name liveLogin
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{testEmail}}",
  "password": "secret456"
}


### 8. Who am I -> expect 200, data.user.role "user", isPaid false
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{liveLogin.response.body.data.token}}


### 9. Forgot password -> expect 200 + a reset email whose link starts with {{site}}/reset-password/...
POST {{api}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{testEmail}}"
}


### 10. Website page refresh works (SPA rewrite) -> expect 200 HTML, not Vercel 404
GET {{site}}/languages


### 11. Unknown page -> expect 200 HTML (React shows the "Page not found" screen)
GET {{site}}/some/unknown/page
